  | 2 => ⟨(204 : ℤ), (-128165330026470633163790151037849513979188332548862722545479 : ℤ), (849972512608248925989157290702615858473532863010397266490925 : ℤ)⟩

theorem V_mem : V.mem (fTop c) := by
